<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market dormant - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market dormant - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area Friday. Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested. Feedlots reporting moderate inquiry from buyers.</p>
<p>Following weekly movement of 106,900 head. Note - all cattle prices based on net weights FOB the feedlot after a 4 percent shrink.</p>
<p>Confirmed - None</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
